      "uid": "zhcn:c07ad07831aeeddb4b01411d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "唯独爱你",
      "source_fingerprint": "9399f1eac3e90e02e56c05a130bf24bc0c3867f6772ed5a8ee1c325df7f0f243",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1132/storytimeline_501132114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fab8c6248a55923d38ab6c72",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "放声酱……！\n好厉害的步速――",
      "source_fingerprint": "64ba8ccbaea8c85a4744b61a4977920a4ee62d87bacd0a38035b7aed46cc6813",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1132/storytimeline_501132114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8818e7c1a0a448c61aa11ccf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "作为初级班的唯独爱你，\n她的身体正处于为了在比赛中\n跑得更快更强的飞速成长阶段。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e7122be6d1c4c12c7d871de190e33d70b5299a75dd8aebd453e4f4509aed1fc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1132/storytimeline_501132114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        50,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/50/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:033013e2fba5dd7d117c8708",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在这种成长中的状态下，\n如果勉强训练的话，\n很可能会直接导致严重的伤病……",
      "source_fingerprint": "835281358db4947179eeae6e1449dac1ab5dcca0b8cb36917a8cf500b940c236",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1132/storytimeline_501132114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        51,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/51/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37ce0337c4c2385d271b534f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因此，作为负责训练员，\n我一直在观察她身体的成长程度，\n并制定最适合她的训练量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48e560f218e15e747214b97efd2efee38c244f913a045eec6b658e3554f8ec5b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1132/storytimeline_501132114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        52,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/52/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d90a2a84b58f681a97163575",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这样的方针，唯独爱你\n应该也是明白的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e10f7e022834c7d08a43ba8ad228f49adc51b3fe9b3a79bbfb05ed91da8a40e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1132/storytimeline_501132114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        53,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/53/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31250f05db5ada824db5d0ce",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "正因为如此，我想好好问问你",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4c7043444117ee93af1a587b16e012c194b212e664fcf7fa96759568a1b2b13",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1132/storytimeline_501132114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        54,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/54/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15173482ca4cdca3d29d7965",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "正因为如此，我想好好地问问你",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5abc83218094464ca9345886c29a24a2221bb9cce1f5ef7f5c5efce4faa4d44",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1132/storytimeline_501132114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        54,
        "choice_data_list",
        1
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/54/choice_data_list/1"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e1a9810f548b783ee02e7b6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我很清楚，\n她是非常聪明的赛马娘，\n这是至今为止每天都能感受到的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eca3ce2852d58bc70b1919ef3d501560e9d4a8704149a9fed3cb37b9733564c7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1132/storytimeline_501132114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        54,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/54/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef7f8a3c08846d4f2c906376",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在明知有这些风险的前提下，\n她还想要更进一步的训练，\n她的想法究竟是――",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3bdc855bb9532a61e7b7327522090dbb2d0590b87d857db6fa4e77860a09e8b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1132/storytimeline_501132114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        55,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/55/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fda4b9e4af68381e9a39693d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "唯独爱你",
      "source_fingerprint": "9399f1eac3e90e02e56c05a130bf24bc0c3867f6772ed5a8ee1c325df7f0f243",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1132/storytimeline_501132114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        56,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/56/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34c915ede231173df0127d1b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "…………――",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b00cec6fe1b69e4117b3369459400ff471b276e72964753fd90a4cf162e1418",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
