      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……自从说出要以经典赛为目标，\n在社群成员面前立下目标后，\n我就开始思考了很多事――",
      "source_fingerprint": "90e5a96e2e4ee91df0c9ddfe80923aa131981b6dc77759e2a2497bdc7ad08bbb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
