      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "结果呢，就燃起了斗志。\n我不想让社群成员失望，\n所以必须更努力才行――",
      "source_fingerprint": "50a95277a0a6cf1c11a732ad7884d71058cd41fd00253500ea7f952e5b74fea4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
